\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces Deep mutational scanning validation. SA-generated substitutions relative to the family consensus were matched to published single-mutant DMS fitness data. Tolerance rate: fraction of matched substitutions classified as functional ($\mathrm  {DMS\_score\_bin}{=}1$). DMS overall: baseline tolerance rate across all single mutations in the dataset. Enrichment: ratio of SA tolerance rate to DMS overall rate. $p$: one-sided binomial test ($H_0$: SA tolerance rate $\leq $ DMS overall rate).}}{25}{table.caption.42}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dms}{{S3}{25}{Deep mutational scanning validation. SA-generated substitutions relative to the family consensus were matched to published single-mutant DMS fitness data. Tolerance rate: fraction of matched substitutions classified as functional ($\mathrm {DMS\_score\_bin}{=}1$). DMS overall: baseline tolerance rate across all single mutations in the dataset. Enrichment: ratio of SA tolerance rate to DMS overall rate. $p$: one-sided binomial test ($H_0$: SA tolerance rate $\leq $ DMS overall rate)}{table.caption.42}{}}
